<title>USA: PC411 Inc to begin trading on SmallCap.</title>
<headline>PC411 Inc to begin trading on SmallCap.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PC411 Inc said Tuesday that it has been approved for listing on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipates that its common stock, redeemable Class A warrants  and Units will begin trading on the SmallCap Market on July 31.</p>
<p>PC411 is an electronic publishing concern that provides on-line directory assistance services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
